OL,3,GNEWSAClosed council care homes sold at
OL,4,Aauction
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo former council-run care homes have
OL,7,Fsold at auction for more than #1.7m.
OL,9,FBriar Close Care Home in Borrowash and
OL,10,FThomas Colledge House in Bolsover were
OL,11,Fsold for #960,000 and #780,000
OL,12,Frespectively after Derbyshire County
OL,13,FCouncil closed them in June as part of
OL,14,Fbudget cuts.
OL,16,FThe sales come just a month after the
OL,17,Fauction of another former council care
OL,18,Fhome, Castle Court in Castle Gresley,
OL,19,Fwhich went under the hammer for #2.59m
OL,20,Fin late September.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
