OL,3,GNEWSAClosed council care homes sold at
OL,4,Aauction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision to sell a total of eight
OL,7,Fcare homes was taken by the previous
OL,8,FConservative administration in late
OL,9,F2024, but a planned sale to a single
OL,10,Foperator by the current Reform UK led
OL,11,Fcouncil fell through in December 2025.
